{"id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-arith0.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy Base Level","display":"df-arith0 — Arithmetical Hierarchy Base Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-arith0","aliases":["57-df-arith0"],"display":"df-arith0 — Arithmetical Hierarchy Base Level","depends_on":["[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[57-df-recursive-function]]","[[57-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-arith0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-arith0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arith0 — Arithmetical Hierarchy Base Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6a5ff61521a8f18\" href=\"?note=d6a5ff61521a8f18\" title=\"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arith0-—-Arithmetical-Hierarchy-Base-Level-$\\Sigma^0_0-=-\\Pi^0_0-=-\\Delta^0_0$\">df-arith0 — Arithmetical Hierarchy Base Level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_0 = \\Pi^0_0 = \\Delta^0_0\">\\(\\Sigma^0_0 = \\Pi^0_0 = \\Delta^0_0\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6a5ff61521a8f18\" href=\"?note=d6a5ff61521a8f18\" title=\"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a> 的一元数值层级及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，自然数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a> 的部分递归函数谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 是下述本地集合类重载，不把函数和自然数集混为一类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rec}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^0=\\Pi_0^0=\\Delta_0^0=\\mathrm{Rec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^0=\\Pi_0^0=\\Delta_0^0=\\mathrm{Rec}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可判定集需要总特征函数；仅有接受时停机的半判定程序不足以证明属于初层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arith0-—-Arithmetical-Hierarchy-Base-Level-$\\Sigma^0_0-=-\\Pi^0_0-=-\\Delta^0_0$","text":"df-arith0 — Arithmetical Hierarchy Base Level $\\Sigma^0_0 = \\Pi^0_0 = \\Delta^0_0$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元数值层级及 $\\chi_A$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 是 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的部分递归函数谓词；$A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}$ 是下述本地集合类重载，不把函数和自然数集混为一类。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元数值层级及 $\\chi_A$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 是 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的部分递归函数谓词；$A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}$ 是下述本地集合类重载，不把函数和自然数集混为一类。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本文件使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元数值层级及 $\\chi_A$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 是 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的部分递归函数谓词；$A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}$ 是下述本地集合类重载，不把函数和自然数集混为一类。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_0 = \\Pi^0_0 = \\Delta^0_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0^0=\\Pi_0^0=\\Delta_0^0=\\mathrm{Rec}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}.","display":true}],"bytes":1054,"backlinks":[{"id":"4107e891ce817208","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为固定的有效可数语言，$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。固定 [[57-df-provable]] 的证明系统 $\\mathcal P$，本文件 $T\\vdash\\varphi$ 指 $T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi$。$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的集合重载见 [[57-df-arith0]]。$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 是理论类，不是自然数集合的可判定类；参数 $L,g,\\mathcal P$ 在各次调用中保持不变。"},{"id":"f09872a0e6f9cd1a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为固定有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$g[\\Phi]$ 为直接像；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[57-df-mod]]。"},{"id":"7ade1cc62edc29c7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为有限的一阶关系语言并至少含一个二元关系符号；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的可判定数值集合类。$\\models$ 为通常非空结构上的一阶有效性；$\\mathrm{Undec}_{\\mathbb N}$ 为下面的数值集合谓词，原 $\\mathrm{Undec}$ 在本文件的数值集合类型上保留为该谓词的别名；与理论类型的调用相区分。"},{"id":"d8ad50b1bb4a4cb1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b0fcfc053ad38255","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为有限的一阶关系语言并至少含一个二元关系符号；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$|\\mathfrak A|$ 表示结构的载体，$\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|$ 表示基数。$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]]，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。"},{"id":"4a894c201e15cf14","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]]。"},{"id":"536f78c4d1ada7bd","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-arith0]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[5